(5836346, 850028, 63716, '<td valign="top">I grew up in Levin. I''d have called Oxford St the main street, but whatever. Yeah this photo conveys the boring boringness of it all. The dog''s a nice touch.</td>', 'I grew up in Levin. I''d have called Oxford St the main street, but whatever. Yeah this photo conveys the boring boringness of it all. The dog''s a nice touch.', '2010-01-27 02:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
