(5836632, 849972, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity/sharpness.  Great blues of the sky.  I like the long exposure and the streaks of lights from the passing cars.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice clarity/sharpness.  Great blues of the sky.  I like the long exposure and the streaks of lights from the passing cars.  Nice shot.', '2010-01-27 06:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836669, 849151, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the general feel of this photo.  It has a nice small town feel.  The facades of the buildings have character for a main street, along with the lamp posts and the brick walkway.  However, the large tree in the right third is a bit "distracting."  I wonder if a different position (perhaps near the closest lamp post or near the big tree) would have captured the essence of this street without the distraction of the tree...  Just a thought.  But then again, perhaps the large tree is part of the character of this main street...  There''s actually a lot to see and wonder about as a viewer.  Great street to capture.</td>', 'I like the general feel of this photo.  It has a nice small town feel.  The facades of the buildings have character for a main street, along with the lamp posts and the brick walkway.  However, the large tree in the right third is a bit "distracting."  I wonder if a different position (perhaps near the closest lamp post or near the big tree) would have captured the essence of this street without the distraction of the tree...  Just a thought.  But then again, perhaps the large tree is part of the character of this main street...  There''s actually a lot to see and wonder about as a viewer.  Great street to capture.', '2010-01-27 06:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836673, 849976, 103032, '<td valign="top">Out of the box, interesting take on the challenge :)  Best of luck on the voting.  (I''d like to see a pic after you''re done with the layout.)</td>', 'Out of the box, interesting take on the challenge :)  Best of luck on the voting.  (I''d like to see a pic after you''re done with the layout.)', '2010-01-27 06:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836688, 849823, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool main street.  About as rural as one can get; something I''m not use to.  Great framing with the huge trees.</td>', 'Pretty cool main street.  About as rural as one can get; something I''m not use to.  Great framing with the huge trees.', '2010-01-27 07:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836700, 849719, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the "tease" of this main street.  By tease, I mean it seems to be a real interesting main street with the neon "Civic" (theater?) sign and the other lights, and the cobble stone sidewalk on the left portion of the shot and the lighted tree lined street, but it''s just a little bit too dark thus lack of details.  I think this would have been a stronger image if this was taken within the hour after sunset (the blue hour) where you could have captured a bit more detail.  This has potential... Just MHO.</td>', 'I like the "tease" of this main street.  By tease, I mean it seems to be a real interesting main street with the neon "Civic" (theater?) sign and the other lights, and the cobble stone sidewalk on the left portion of the shot and the lighted tree lined street, but it''s just a little bit too dark thus lack of details.  I think this would have been a stronger image if this was taken within the hour after sunset (the blue hour) where you could have captured a bit more detail.  This has potential... Just MHO.', '2010-01-27 07:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5836703, 849973, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is a cool snow street scene with the streaks of light.</td>', 'This is a cool snow street scene with the streaks of light.', '2010-01-27 07:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
