(5837133, 850057, 76585, '<td valign="top">Amazing work, I love the fisheye and your exposure is right on. 10</td>', 'Amazing work, I love the fisheye and your exposure is right on. 10', '2010-01-27 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837141, 850079, 66038, '<td valign="top">THis would have been good, with the receding lines and all working for it, but it looks overprocessed. It no longer looks like a photograph.  The photo lost it''s soul.<br/> I would have scored it higher if not for that.</td>', 'THis would have been good, with the receding lines and all working for it, but it looks overprocessed. It no longer looks like a photograph.  The photo lost it''s soul. I would have scored it higher if not for that.', '2010-01-27 09:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837264, 850056, 113740, '<td valign="top">I love this. Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love this. Very nicely done.', '2010-01-27 10:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837333, 849925, 66038, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this. The sky and the lit interior compliment each other.</td>', 'I love the colors in this. The sky and the lit interior compliment each other.', '2010-01-27 10:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837369, 849776, 113995, '<td valign="top">it seems way too dark.</td>', 'it seems way too dark.', '2010-01-27 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837406, 850062, 10785, '<td valign="top">The cloudy sky adds great interest to the scene. The photo appears to be very oversharpened as there are noticeable jpg "jaggies" on every horizontal and diagonal line in the photo. The choice of sepia was good but the use of the bright white border conflicts with the sepia tone of the photo.</td>', 'The cloudy sky adds great interest to the scene. The photo appears to be very oversharpened as there are noticeable jpg "jaggies" on every horizontal and diagonal line in the photo. The choice of sepia was good but the use of the bright white border conflicts with the sepia tone of the photo.', '2010-01-27 10:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837421, 850128, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W conversion with a wide range of tones none blown out or hidden in dark shadow. Great sky top to add interest to the scene. One thing lacking is people or activity. Otherwise a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent B&W conversion with a wide range of tones none blown out or hidden in dark shadow. Great sky top to add interest to the scene. One thing lacking is people or activity. Otherwise a great photo.', '2010-01-27 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837426, 849157, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very humorous take.</td>', 'Very humorous take.', '2010-01-27 10:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837440, 850015, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is a bit too literal an interpretation of the challenge. You have the street shown and for composition it has some leading lines in it but it really doesn''t lead you to anything.</td>', 'I think this photo is a bit too literal an interpretation of the challenge. You have the street shown and for composition it has some leading lines in it but it really doesn''t lead you to anything.', '2010-01-27 10:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837461, 849976, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, well exposed and possibly useful for a book on model railroading or something. Everything is in focus and clear. It has a documentary feel that meets the challenge but lacks interest as artwork.</td>', 'This is a good photo, well exposed and possibly useful for a book on model railroading or something. Everything is in focus and clear. It has a documentary feel that meets the challenge but lacks interest as artwork.', '2010-01-27 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837465, 850070, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the long exposure shots for the main street challenge. Here you got the lights reflecting off the damp pavement which I like, but you lost the color and there isn''t much details elsewhere. I think the white balance is off as shown by the red glow of the street lights.</td>', 'I like the long exposure shots for the main street challenge. Here you got the lights reflecting off the damp pavement which I like, but you lost the color and there isn''t much details elsewhere. I think the white balance is off as shown by the red glow of the street lights.', '2010-01-27 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837519, 850145, 71244, '<td valign="top">this looks like a courthouse square in mississippi...</td>', 'this looks like a courthouse square in mississippi...', '2010-01-27 11:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5837533, 850145, 113278, '<td valign="top">It is too bad you couldn''t get this shot with the cars gone, they are a bit distracting to an overall great image. Maybe if it was cropped just abover the cars? just my own opinion.</td>', 'It is too bad you couldn''t get this shot with the cars gone, they are a bit distracting to an overall great image. Maybe if it was cropped just abover the cars? just my own opinion.', '2010-01-27 11:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
