(5838283, 849963, 92577, '<td valign="top">When you first start learning about photography they always tell you to find a different angle or viewpoint to make your picture stand out. Something as basic as that has really given your picture a different feel in this challenge.It''s amazing that so many have either forgotten or just haven''t bothered - good luck!</td>', 'When you first start learning about photography they always tell you to find a different angle or viewpoint to make your picture stand out. Something as basic as that has really given your picture a different feel in this challenge.It''s amazing that so many have either forgotten or just haven''t bothered - good luck!', '2010-01-27 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
