(5838368, 849925, 66384, '<td valign="top">That''s a funny name for a street. I like the image -- nice and crisp and clean. Lovely colors, and nice light.</td>', 'That''s a funny name for a street. I like the image -- nice and crisp and clean. Lovely colors, and nice light.', '2010-01-27 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838376, 849973, 66384, '<td valign="top">The light trail is cool. It makes it look like the roundabout is lit with neon. Odd though that there is no car to go with the lights. It seems a bit blown out in the gas station, but I like the composition and overall, I like the image.</td>', 'The light trail is cool. It makes it look like the roundabout is lit with neon. Odd though that there is no car to go with the lights. It seems a bit blown out in the gas station, but I like the composition and overall, I like the image.', '2010-01-27 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838388, 850087, 66384, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this is not Main Street. The house, hedge, and fence don''t look like they are that rural. As for the composition, I think cropping a good amount off the bottom would help, and perhaps a slight rotation counter-clockwise, would make it feel less tilted (the fence posts and downspouts are not perpendicular).</td>', 'I have a feeling this is not Main Street. The house, hedge, and fence don''t look like they are that rural. As for the composition, I think cropping a good amount off the bottom would help, and perhaps a slight rotation counter-clockwise, would make it feel less tilted (the fence posts and downspouts are not perpendicular).', '2010-01-27 16:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838391, 849902, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool image. Because of the noise, I wonder if it was shot with an iPhone. :) Actually, I don''t think the noise adds anything to this image, so my preference would be to remove it. I really like the composition, the colors, and the starry red lights.</td>', 'Cool image. Because of the noise, I wonder if it was shot with an iPhone. :) Actually, I don''t think the noise adds anything to this image, so my preference would be to remove it. I really like the composition, the colors, and the starry red lights.', '2010-01-27 16:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838394, 850023, 66384, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a bright sunny day, but the image seems subdued. Perhaps a levels adjustment would brighten it.</td>', 'It seems to be a bright sunny day, but the image seems subdued. Perhaps a levels adjustment would brighten it.', '2010-01-27 16:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838399, 850121, 66384, '<td valign="top">Odd name for a main street. Nice image though and a good representation of life on Poser Street.</td>', 'Odd name for a main street. Nice image though and a good representation of life on Poser Street.', '2010-01-27 16:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838406, 850123, 66384, '<td valign="top">Except for the car models, this looks like a photo from an old scrap book. Very nice tone.</td>', 'Except for the car models, this looks like a photo from an old scrap book. Very nice tone.', '2010-01-27 16:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
