(5838780, 850023, 47541, '<td valign="top">What was the message you were trying to get across here? I''m struggling to find a lot to interest me :(</td>', 'What was the message you were trying to get across here? I''m struggling to find a lot to interest me :(', '2010-01-27 19:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838784, 849823, 98647, '<td valign="top">When this first loaded I thought it was a shot of just trees. I would have cropped off some of the top, the bottom is far more interesting.</td>', 'When this first loaded I thought it was a shot of just trees. I would have cropped off some of the top, the bottom is far more interesting.', '2010-01-27 19:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838788, 850057, 47541, '<td valign="top">Cool star shapes in the lights, the distortion doesn''t work for me</td>', 'Cool star shapes in the lights, the distortion doesn''t work for me', '2010-01-27 19:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838792, 850068, 47541, '<td valign="top">Is that really a street? It doesn''t look like it to me - DNMC sorry</td>', 'Is that really a street? It doesn''t look like it to me - DNMC sorry', '2010-01-27 19:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838801, 850143, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the movement and the business</td>', 'Great shot, love the movement and the business', '2010-01-27 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838802, 850109, 113926, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear with truck wizzing by wish I was there looks like a great street.</td>', 'Nice and clear with truck wizzing by wish I was there looks like a great street.', '2010-01-27 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838804, 849151, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nothing special but nice to look at</td>', 'Nice shot, nothing special but nice to look at', '2010-01-27 19:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838805, 849973, 47541, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, I love the lack of colour and the curve of the lights</td>', 'Really nice shot, I love the lack of colour and the curve of the lights', '2010-01-27 19:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5838807, 850079, 47541, '<td valign="top">Too processed for my liking but I do like the detail in the trees</td>', 'Too processed for my liking but I do like the detail in the trees', '2010-01-27 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839076, 849963, 23098, '<td valign="top">Your perspective is unique, giving this shot a lot of appeal, at least for me.  Detail, b&amp;w treatment are very effective. Nice work. I suspect that you are getting some good comments and votes.</td>', 'Your perspective is unique, giving this shot a lot of appeal, at least for me.  Detail, b&w treatment are very effective. Nice work. I suspect that you are getting some good comments and votes.', '2010-01-27 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839079, 849964, 23098, '<td valign="top">Outstanding! The detail, b&amp;w, lights, all spellbinding. Great job.</td>', 'Outstanding! The detail, b&w, lights, all spellbinding. Great job.', '2010-01-27 21:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839080, 850176, 23098, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! I like the colors, motion and perspective. Nice job.</td>', 'This is really cool! I like the colors, motion and perspective. Nice job.', '2010-01-27 21:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839081, 850076, 23098, '<td valign="top">Eyecatching, like your lens choice.</td>', 'Eyecatching, like your lens choice.', '2010-01-27 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839108, 850028, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL but did ya ever notice all little towns have a dog or two? Very cute and I like it.</td>', 'LOL but did ya ever notice all little towns have a dog or two? Very cute and I like it.', '2010-01-27 21:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839133, 849851, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice. I think the b&amp;w works well with this shot. Good work.</td>', 'Nice. I think the b&w works well with this shot. Good work.', '2010-01-27 21:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839146, 850029, 327, '<td valign="top">That''s a view! Nice one.</td>', 'That''s a view! Nice one.', '2010-01-27 21:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839155, 850170, 327, '<td valign="top">My kind of town...sorry I won''t sing. Nice and I particularly like the moving people and the tones here.</td>', 'My kind of town...sorry I won''t sing. Nice and I particularly like the moving people and the tones here.', '2010-01-27 21:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839157, 849964, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, great rich tones.</td>', 'Pretty shot, great rich tones.', '2010-01-27 21:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839161, 850145, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice. Your town looks about as small as mine. :) Clean shot, good composition.</td>', 'Nice. Your town looks about as small as mine. :) Clean shot, good composition.', '2010-01-27 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839166, 849151, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute, quaint and charming. Very nice.</td>', 'Cute, quaint and charming. Very nice.', '2010-01-27 21:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839171, 850058, 111625, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, nice shot</td>', 'I like the colors, nice shot', '2010-01-27 21:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839178, 849903, 327, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot, focus is spot on.</td>', 'Good clean shot, focus is spot on.', '2010-01-27 21:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839186, 849932, 111625, '<td valign="top">Only picture in the entire challenge that I can say "I''ve been there" (except mine of course)</td>', 'Only picture in the entire challenge that I can say "I''ve been there" (except mine of course)', '2010-01-27 21:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839218, 850057, 105441, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but the fisheye effect seems limited primarily to the light pole.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but the fisheye effect seems limited primarily to the light pole.', '2010-01-27 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839220, 850128, 105441, '<td valign="top">I like the BW treatment, and the lack of clutter on the street.</td>', 'I like the BW treatment, and the lack of clutter on the street.', '2010-01-27 22:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839225, 850056, 39880, '<td valign="top">I think this one will be the winner.  It has a nice look to it.  I like the motion of the people.</td>', 'I think this one will be the winner.  It has a nice look to it.  I like the motion of the people.', '2010-01-27 22:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839229, 850056, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W, with great light &amp; reflections from the wet pavement.  Would prefer the bus was out of the picture, but still nice. 7</td>', 'Nice B&W, with great light & reflections from the wet pavement.  Would prefer the bus was out of the picture, but still nice. 7', '2010-01-27 22:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839230, 850056, 23317, '<td valign="top">Love the tone.</td>', 'Love the tone.', '2010-01-27 22:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839239, 850160, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but "Main Street"?</td>', 'Nice image, but "Main Street"?', '2010-01-27 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839266, 849963, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, use of B&amp;W, long shadows.  Would be better without the man, though.  7</td>', 'Nice perspective, use of B&W, long shadows.  Would be better without the man, though.  7', '2010-01-27 22:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839267, 849902, 103032, '<td valign="top">My first impression is, "that sucks (rush hour traffic), I know what that''s like."  You got my emotional vote.  I think most Americans in a large city can relate to this pic.  <br/>ETA: I think this caught the essence of a main street that is a different take.  A lot of the other submissions are the "pretty" side of a main street.  I think this will be(?) one of the under rated images.</td>', 'My first impression is, "that sucks (rush hour traffic), I know what that''s like."  You got my emotional vote.  I think most Americans in a large city can relate to this pic.  ETA: I think this caught the essence of a main street that is a different take.  A lot of the other submissions are the "pretty" side of a main street.  I think this will be(?) one of the under rated images.', '2010-01-27 22:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839275, 850170, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice representation of a core downtown street.  Like your vantage point looking down the middle of the street.  Whether intentional or not, I like the slight blur of the people in the crosswalk showing movement.  This "duotone" treatment is fine, but I wouldn''t mind if you posted the color version in the photographer''s notes after the voting just for comparison purposes.</td>', 'Nice representation of a core downtown street.  Like your vantage point looking down the middle of the street.  Whether intentional or not, I like the slight blur of the people in the crosswalk showing movement.  This "duotone" treatment is fine, but I wouldn''t mind if you posted the color version in the photographer''s notes after the voting just for comparison purposes.', '2010-01-27 22:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839280, 849976, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - one of the best concepts so far.  I like the diagram with "Main Street" shown. The lighting is not very inspiring, but the idea is great. 7</td>', 'Nicely done - one of the best concepts so far.  I like the diagram with "Main Street" shown. The lighting is not very inspiring, but the idea is great. 7', '2010-01-27 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839286, 850076, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a crazy POV.  Camera set on the ground, slightly tilted???<br/>ETA: Bumping up because the fisheye is just cool.</td>', 'Wow, this is a crazy POV.  Camera set on the ground, slightly tilted???ETA: Bumping up because the fisheye is just cool.', '2010-01-27 22:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839304, 850056, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like how the viewer is lead straight down this main street.  I like how you processed this.  Nicely presented.  <br/>Bumping up on the second run through.  This would be one of my picks for a ribbon.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like how the viewer is lead straight down this main street.  I like how you processed this.  Nicely presented.  Bumping up on the second run through.  This would be one of my picks for a ribbon.', '2010-01-27 22:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839319, 850143, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the street capture.  One of the more engaging compositions so far.  But the processing is just a bit much on the purple/blue side.  It looks too unnatural...  Just MHO.<br/>ETA:  Even though I think its a bit too much on the blue hues, I''m bumping up because it''s one of the most engaging compositions.</td>', 'I like the street capture.  One of the more engaging compositions so far.  But the processing is just a bit much on the purple/blue side.  It looks too unnatural...  Just MHO.ETA:  Even though I think its a bit too much on the blue hues, I''m bumping up because it''s one of the most engaging compositions.', '2010-01-27 22:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839475, 850056, 100393, '<td valign="top">Utterly fabulous image; really beautiful.</td>', 'Utterly fabulous image; really beautiful.', '2010-01-27 23:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839492, 849898, 75618, '<td valign="top">I remember those lights on the way to Luneta Park... =)</td>', 'I remember those lights on the way to Luneta Park... =)', '2010-01-27 23:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839498, 849477, 75618, '<td valign="top">BERKELEY!</td>', 'BERKELEY!', '2010-01-28 00:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839581, 849151, 113976, '<td valign="top">The lights look like you over adjusted the picture too much, but I like it overall.</td>', 'The lights look like you over adjusted the picture too much, but I like it overall.', '2010-01-28 01:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839588, 849973, 113976, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2010-01-28 01:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839619, 850176, 111625, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite from this challenge</td>', 'This is my favorite from this challenge', '2010-01-28 02:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839650, 849964, 103048, '<td valign="top">Wow perfectly done! 10</td>', 'Wow perfectly done! 10', '2010-01-28 03:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839685, 850056, 109478, '<td valign="top">Nice color ,composition and mood. Those blur people with umbrella are fantastic, their positions and motions are very proper in the compostion. Great capture! 9<br/>After looking through all the entries in this challenge, I believe that this photo will win the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Nice color ,composition and mood. Those blur people with umbrella are fantastic, their positions and motions are very proper in the compostion. Great capture! 9After looking through all the entries in this challenge, I believe that this photo will win the blue ribbon.', '2010-01-28 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839711, 850119, 105130, '<td valign="top">It''s a <i>little</i> dark, but the leading lines are nice and clean and interest is increased by the longer exposure. Para onde é que ias? :-)</td>', 'It''s a little dark, but the leading lines are nice and clean and interest is increased by the longer exposure. Para onde é que ias? :-)', '2010-01-28 04:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5839743, 849964, 105130, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp, stong leading lines and great post-processing. My favourite for the challenge - good luck!</td>', 'Clean, crisp, stong leading lines and great post-processing. My favourite for the challenge - good luck!', '2010-01-28 05:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
