(5843287, 850027, 99263, '<td valign="top">Long street Cape Town. Yes I know it so very well and for that reason I can say that you could have found a much more interesting angle from which to take a really super special shot of this street especially including some of those fantastic Victorian style buildings with the ornate balustrades. Just Google Long street Cape Town under "Images" and see all the possibilities. This shot just does not do it justice sorry to say.</td>', 'Long street Cape Town. Yes I know it so very well and for that reason I can say that you could have found a much more interesting angle from which to take a really super special shot of this street especially including some of those fantastic Victorian style buildings with the ornate balustrades. Just Google Long street Cape Town under "Images" and see all the possibilities. This shot just does not do it justice sorry to say.', '2010-01-29 12:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
