(5843506, 849972, 28427, '<td valign="top">There''s so much going on in this photograph, that it makes me smile and imagine things.  Like, what if the red light would have turned green and they were both showing? Would have been great. And like: The white car lights are passing like a "swoosh" and the red ones like a "bumpetebump".<br/>Let this score be a "bump" : 9</td>', 'There''s so much going on in this photograph, that it makes me smile and imagine things.  Like, what if the red light would have turned green and they were both showing? Would have been great. And like: The white car lights are passing like a "swoosh" and the red ones like a "bumpetebump".Let this score be a "bump" : 9', '2010-01-29 14:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
