(5843508, 850028, 28427, '<td valign="top">You can''t help the town''s boring. At least you did an effort to find something interesting to photograph.  My town is that boring I didn''t even bother going out there and showing it to people.</td>', 'You can''t help the town''s boring. At least you did an effort to find something interesting to photograph.  My town is that boring I didn''t even bother going out there and showing it to people.', '2010-01-29 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843516, 850143, 28427, '<td valign="top">I looked at all the billboards - West Side Story?? - , all the people passing by, their paths they follow(ed), the lights... such a great photograph worthy a 10!</td>', 'I looked at all the billboards - West Side Story?? - , all the people passing by, their paths they follow(ed), the lights... such a great photograph worthy a 10!', '2010-01-29 14:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843517, 850062, 28427, '<td valign="top">I just hope you won''t be DQ for the border.  I think, but I''m not sure - and I do hope I''m wrong - that this is a you-may-not in basic editing.<br/>However, I''ll pretend I didn''t see the border. The sepia works well in this photograph.  Maybe a bit lighter/less hard? I would have to see both versions next to each other then.  Overall: nice photograph of what seems a cosy main street.</td>', 'I just hope you won''t be DQ for the border.  I think, but I''m not sure - and I do hope I''m wrong - that this is a you-may-not in basic editing.However, I''ll pretend I didn''t see the border. The sepia works well in this photograph.  Maybe a bit lighter/less hard? I would have to see both versions next to each other then.  Overall: nice photograph of what seems a cosy main street.', '2010-01-29 14:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5843518, 850154, 28427, '<td valign="top">I like their sign on side walk :) They must really pamper their customers. Yet another photograph of a cosy main street.</td>', 'I like their sign on side walk :) They must really pamper their customers. Yet another photograph of a cosy main street.', '2010-01-29 14:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
