(5849715, 849813, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great use of the reflection. Good clarity but I may have cropped a little tighter to exclude the brick wall. Nice take all the same.</td>', 'Great use of the reflection. Good clarity but I may have cropped a little tighter to exclude the brick wall. Nice take all the same.', '2010-02-02 21:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849716, 849157, 94235, '<td valign="top">What is he doing?? The things you see out on the street! Well captured.</td>', 'What is he doing?? The things you see out on the street! Well captured.', '2010-02-02 21:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849717, 849151, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the touch with the cloud color in the background.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the touch with the cloud color in the background.', '2010-02-02 21:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849720, 850028, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice dog. Where''s the street?</td>', 'Nice dog. Where''s the street?', '2010-02-02 21:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849722, 849997, 25773, '<td valign="top">Very stylish; everything spot-on.</td>', 'Very stylish; everything spot-on.', '2010-02-02 21:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849723, 850056, 94235, '<td valign="top">My favorite. Great shot and well done. Ribbon coming your way for sure!</td>', 'My favorite. Great shot and well done. Ribbon coming your way for sure!', '2010-02-02 21:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849724, 849903, 94235, '<td valign="top">The building at the end of the street makes this shot. Well captured and good use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'The building at the end of the street makes this shot. Well captured and good use of B&W.', '2010-02-02 21:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849725, 850087, 94235, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Well taken.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Well taken.', '2010-02-02 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849729, 849964, 25773, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspectives and lights.</td>', 'Very cool perspectives and lights.', '2010-02-02 21:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849730, 849851, 94235, '<td valign="top">I can smell that fresh mountain air. Well captured.</td>', 'I can smell that fresh mountain air. Well captured.', '2010-02-02 21:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849758, 849963, 94815, '<td valign="top">Great pov. I''m dying to know what camera was used.</td>', 'Great pov. I''m dying to know what camera was used.', '2010-02-02 21:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849761, 849035, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good street scene and lovely colors.</td>', 'Good street scene and lovely colors.', '2010-02-02 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849763, 849559, 94815, '<td valign="top">In bw this could be called, White ONLY. Good eye.</td>', 'In bw this could be called, White ONLY. Good eye.', '2010-02-02 21:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849778, 850170, 94815, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed with the pedestrians and crosswalk lines establishing a frontal plane like a theater stage screen. Somehow the sepia helps the effect because it lets us see it apart from the too familiar bad color or bw. So, we can then dwell on the receding perspective that wants to pull us in through the veil into the stage.</td>', 'Nicely framed with the pedestrians and crosswalk lines establishing a frontal plane like a theater stage screen. Somehow the sepia helps the effect because it lets us see it apart from the too familiar bad color or bw. So, we can then dwell on the receding perspective that wants to pull us in through the veil into the stage.', '2010-02-02 21:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849782, 850058, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely effects of color against the desat blue-gray bg. The road is seductive as it tries to pull us into the adventure in the distance. Cinematic and sensitively processed.</td>', 'Lovely effects of color against the desat blue-gray bg. The road is seductive as it tries to pull us into the adventure in the distance. Cinematic and sensitively processed.', '2010-02-02 21:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849786, 850062, 94815, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 in spite of the quality of the shot and processing. The border is a bust however (seriously). Give it up in the future and let the art of the photograph stand on its own.</td>', 'I gave this a 5 in spite of the quality of the shot and processing. The border is a bust however (seriously). Give it up in the future and let the art of the photograph stand on its own.', '2010-02-02 21:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849791, 849903, 94815, '<td valign="top">Very nicely framed with the line from the lower right up to the important (capital) building.</td>', 'Very nicely framed with the line from the lower right up to the important (capital) building.', '2010-02-02 21:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849795, 850176, 94815, '<td valign="top">A rare success of night lights well managed and not so typically clicheed.</td>', 'A rare success of night lights well managed and not so typically clicheed.', '2010-02-02 21:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849807, 849851, 94815, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful compositional feel almost like seeing a fine painting. What makes it work is the opposing corner emphasis of the dark car in the lower right balancing the building in the upper left. Mathematically an uneven match but visually perfect. The lines leading back and forth across the street tie it all together with lots of detailed, especially vertical lines providing visual counterpoint.</td>', 'This has a wonderful compositional feel almost like seeing a fine painting. What makes it work is the opposing corner emphasis of the dark car in the lower right balancing the building in the upper left. Mathematically an uneven match but visually perfect. The lines leading back and forth across the street tie it all together with lots of detailed, especially vertical lines providing visual counterpoint.', '2010-02-02 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849808, 849823, 94815, '<td valign="top">If the Impressionists had digital cameras this is what they would do. Well done.</td>', 'If the Impressionists had digital cameras this is what they would do. Well done.', '2010-02-02 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849810, 850056, 78638, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. An instant fav. The I love the lights and the thick, atmospheric air. The composition is great and really draws me in. The duotones are prefect for the mood.</td>', 'This is fantastic. An instant fav. The I love the lights and the thick, atmospheric air. The composition is great and really draws me in. The duotones are prefect for the mood.', '2010-02-02 21:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849812, 850128, 94815, '<td valign="top">Every town has a "Broad" street but you give this one a life that transcends the usual clichés. I think it''s the angle and slight tilt together with the strong contrast that makes it work.</td>', 'Every town has a "Broad" street but you give this one a life that transcends the usual clichés. I think it''s the angle and slight tilt together with the strong contrast that makes it work.', '2010-02-02 21:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849888, 850008, 83313, '<td valign="top">My eye is not really drawn to anything in particular about this scene. It goes to the middle of the intersection, to find... nothing.</td>', 'My eye is not really drawn to anything in particular about this scene. It goes to the middle of the intersection, to find... nothing.', '2010-02-02 22:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849892, 849963, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love this! The ground level perspective is perfect and it frames the rest of the shot well. The b/w treatment gives it a bit of an old fashioned look, in spite of the modern elements. Oh, and there is a bicycle in the photo. You are getting down to the level I like to shoot at. I''ll bet the ground was cold that day.</td>', 'I love this! The ground level perspective is perfect and it frames the rest of the shot well. The b/w treatment gives it a bit of an old fashioned look, in spite of the modern elements. Oh, and there is a bicycle in the photo. You are getting down to the level I like to shoot at. I''ll bet the ground was cold that day.', '2010-02-02 22:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849893, 850015, 83313, '<td valign="top">Clear and sharp, but it''s not coming off to well other than that, I''m afraid. The extremely centered horizon  doesn''t help to lead my eye around the frame and there is not any particular element that says "look here".</td>', 'Clear and sharp, but it''s not coming off to well other than that, I''m afraid. The extremely centered horizon  doesn''t help to lead my eye around the frame and there is not any particular element that says "look here".', '2010-02-02 22:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849894, 850058, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, this is certainly not the big city!</td>', 'Well, this is certainly not the big city!', '2010-02-02 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849898, 849902, 83313, '<td valign="top">I am grateful to not live in New York. Makes LBJ in Dallas look like a drive in the country.</td>', 'I am grateful to not live in New York. Makes LBJ in Dallas look like a drive in the country.', '2010-02-02 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849902, 850160, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if Egypt has the climate to produce this sort of fog. Perhaps this is really Podunkville USA, or Podunk-on-Green in the UK.</td>', 'I''m not sure if Egypt has the climate to produce this sort of fog. Perhaps this is really Podunkville USA, or Podunk-on-Green in the UK.', '2010-02-02 22:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849910, 850176, 83313, '<td valign="top">Overall good, but the tilt really kills the impact. Seeing that the street is level, I suppose you had to choose what was to be tilted and I would have then nitpicked about the tilted street. Damned if you do, damned if you don''t.</td>', 'Overall good, but the tilt really kills the impact. Seeing that the street is level, I suppose you had to choose what was to be tilted and I would have then nitpicked about the tilted street. Damned if you do, damned if you don''t.', '2010-02-02 22:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849911, 850023, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised at how few High Streets I''m seeing in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m surprised at how few High Streets I''m seeing in this challenge.', '2010-02-02 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849915, 849157, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s a darn good thing that chicken suit has a head to hide one''s identity. But work is work, right?</td>', 'It''s a darn good thing that chicken suit has a head to hide one''s identity. But work is work, right?', '2010-02-02 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849917, 849164, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like the middle of rush hour.</td>', 'Looks like the middle of rush hour.', '2010-02-02 23:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5849919, 849958, 83313, '<td valign="top">Far from a perfect shot. Overly dark shadows, blown highlights. A point well made, however, and that gets it a vote on the positive side of the scale from me.</td>', 'Far from a perfect shot. Overly dark shadows, blown highlights. A point well made, however, and that gets it a vote on the positive side of the scale from me.', '2010-02-02 23:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
