(5850467, 850056, 105130, '<td valign="top">This is thoroughly deserving of the score and the blue ribbon. Congratulations on a superb photo.<br/> <br/>Edit: Came back to say: have you realised yet that you have the best score for camera body <b>and</b> lens? :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-02-03 07:48:34.</i></td>', 'This is thoroughly deserving of the score and the blue ribbon. Congratulations on a superb photo. Edit: Came back to say: have you realised yet that you have the best score for camera body and lens? :-)', '2010-02-03 07:47:10.000000', '2010-02-03 07:48:34.000000', 0),
