(5850628, 850079, 66038, '<td valign="top">Sorry if you didn''t appreciate some of the comments. It''s a photo judging site so it''s all subjective. This particualr work did not do it for me. I prefer the less processed look. <br/> After going through your other submissions I found a lot of things I absolutely loved. I would love to see the original of this one. I bet I like it too.</td>', 'Sorry if you didn''t appreciate some of the comments. It''s a photo judging site so it''s all subjective. This particualr work did not do it for me. I prefer the less processed look.  After going through your other submissions I found a lot of things I absolutely loved. I would love to see the original of this one. I bet I like it too.', '2010-02-03 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
