(5858287, 849963, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. this is fantastic .. love your black and white process and all the lines going on with the buildings and shadows etc .. the legs walking .. the other guy .. just brilliant .. congrats on such a great image and the yellow . :)<br/>what i particularly love about this along with it being a wonderful image is imagining the photographer in a public place down on the ground taking the pic .. lol .. great stuff .. :)</td>', 'WOW .. this is fantastic .. love your black and white process and all the lines going on with the buildings and shadows etc .. the legs walking .. the other guy .. just brilliant .. congrats on such a great image and the yellow . :)what i particularly love about this along with it being a wonderful image is imagining the photographer in a public place down on the ground taking the pic .. lol .. great stuff .. :)', '2010-02-08 02:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
