(5888063, 850105, 30861, '<td valign="top">Regarding the relatively low score, two things strike me:<br/> <br/>1. "DOG Street" looks very odd and contrived. Simply calling it "Main Street" or "Shop Window, Main Street" would have helped, and even calling it "Duke Of Gloucester Street" would have been an improvement if you insist on accuracy.<br/> <br/>2. The framing on the right side is unfortunate, the way the kid lines up with those details, looks very unnatural, like some sort of odd, super-straight back on the kid.<br/> <br/>I think both these things hurt you a little, for what it''s worth...</td>', 'Regarding the relatively low score, two things strike me: 1. "DOG Street" looks very odd and contrived. Simply calling it "Main Street" or "Shop Window, Main Street" would have helped, and even calling it "Duke Of Gloucester Street" would have been an improvement if you insist on accuracy. 2. The framing on the right side is unfortunate, the way the kid lines up with those details, looks very unnatural, like some sort of odd, super-straight back on the kid. I think both these things hurt you a little, for what it''s worth...', '2010-03-03 06:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
